  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math><br /><br />Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using, the given relation, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
